    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Longest valid window</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-repeating-character-replacement/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 424</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Longest Repeating Character Replacement</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A window can be made one letter with at most k changes exactly when (window size - count of its most common letter) &lt;= k. Grow the window to the right; when it breaks the rule, slide it by one instead of shrinking it. The final window size is the answer. O(n) time, O(26) space.</p>\n"
